  "sn12.32:8.4": "",
  "sn12.32:8.5": "Read <i lang='pi' translate='no'>khīṇasmiṁ khīṇam’iti</i> with PTS and BJT, paralleling the common phrase <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vimuttasmiṁ vimuttam’iti</i> (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn12.61/en/sujato#6.2'>SN 12.61:6.2</a>). | The syntax here is convoluted: “With the end of that source which is the source of rebirth, I knew regarding that ending, ‘it is ended’.” ",
