  "sn12.32:12.1": "",
  "sn12.32:12.2": "The Buddha focuses in on the topic of feelings. The commentary explains this with reference to the Dīghanakhasutta (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn74/en/sujato'>MN 74</a>), which relates the occasion Sāriputta realized arahantship. The main topic, and the basis for Sāriputta’s insight, was feelings. The Buddha wanted to give Sāriputta the chance to highlight his special domain. ",
